    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1164763396",
      "Source": "Works as an Egg Incubator!<#RN#><#RN#>Place fertilized eggs inside and have a tamed Supercephalosornis sit on the nest to incubate them with enhanced speeds.<#RN#><#RN#>Requires a tamed Supercephalosornis sitting on the nest.<#RN#><#RN#>- To Get a Super to sit on nest, toggle the option in a tamed Super's Radial Wheel.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"可作为蛋孵化器使用！<#RN#><#RN#>将受精的蛋放入其中，并让已驯服的超冠鸟坐在巢上，以加快孵化速度。<#RN#><#RN#>需要已驯服的超冠鸟坐在巢上。<#RN#><#RN#>- 要让超冠鸟坐在巢上，在已驯服的超冠鸟的径向菜单中选择该选项。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
